>> q := Jokkalante ← 1 ; 2 ; 3.
{ q ? ['1']. } jàpp: { Génn bind: ['caught!'], taxaw. }, dox.
{ q ? Dëgg. } jàpp: { Génn bind: ['caught!'], taxaw. }, dox.
{ q ? Dëkkul. } jàpp: { Génn bind: ['caught!'], taxaw. }, dox.
{ q ? Dara. } jàpp: { Génn bind: ['caught!'], taxaw. }, dox.
{ q ? (Jokkalante xees). } jàpp: { Génn bind: ['caught!'], taxaw. }, dox.
{ q ? (Denc xees). } jàpp: { Génn bind: ['caught!'], taxaw. }, dox.
{ q ? ({ ['Empty']. }). } jàpp: { Génn bind: ['caught!'], taxaw. }, dox.
Génn bind: ['caught them all'], taxaw.
